[Name] Fribidi
[Summary] Free Unicode Bidirectional Algorithm library
[Description] FriBidi implements the Unicode Bidirectional Algorithm and is required by Pango and GTK4 for shaping right-to-left scripts (Arabic, Hebrew, etc.). Not shipped on the 017.01 ISO. Build BEFORE HarfBuzz + Pango. Track: ~/.claude/projects/-home-nohearth-Projects-BuildLiveCD/memory/pantheon-stack-port.md
